WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:06.618
"Rat? Mole? Badger?" Toad called.

2
00:00:06.619 --> 00:00:09.684
He listened in the dark.

3
00:00:09.685 --> 00:00:12.210
There was no answer.

4
00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:18.455
"This tunnel is so cold and small," said Toad.

5
00:00:18.456 --> 00:00:23.576
Toad heard something scratching nearby.

6
00:00:23.577 --> 00:00:25.900
"Ahhh!" he cried.

7
00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:29.679
Toad ran wildly through the dark.

8
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.692
He bumped into an animal with a sword.

9
00:00:34.693 --> 00:00:37.624
"Hey!" said Rat.

10
00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:40.600
Rat stumbled into Mole.

11
00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.854
"Ow!" said Mole.

12
00:00:42.855 --> 00:00:46.677
Mole bumped into Badger.

13
00:00:46.678 --> 00:00:49.974
"Look out!" yelled Badger.

14
00:00:49.975 --> 00:00:53.643
"I think we're being attacked!"

15
00:00:53.644 --> 00:00:58.349
"It's only me!" cried Toad.

16
00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.493
"Toad!" said Badger.

17
00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:04.577
"You must go back!"

18
00:01:04.578 --> 00:01:08.279
"Oh please, Badger!" cried Toad.

19
00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:11.321
"Let him stay," said Rat.

20
00:01:11.322 --> 00:01:14.835
"I'll take care of him."

21
00:01:14.836 --> 00:01:17.634
They set off again.

22
00:01:17.635 --> 00:01:21.802
Rat kept his hand on Toad's shoulder.

23
00:01:21.803 --> 00:01:25.468
They hurried forward in silence.

24
00:01:25.469 --> 00:01:30.213
Suddenly they heard voices.

25
00:01:30.214 --> 00:01:34.540
"We're under the hall," said Badger.

26
00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:38.787
They heard stamping and clapping.

27
00:01:38.788 --> 00:01:43.457
Voices shouted, "Hooray! Hooray!

28
00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:47.444
Weasels are the best!"

29
00:01:47.445 --> 00:01:52.028
Glasses clinked and fists pounded.

30
00:01:52.029 --> 00:01:56.519
"I'll bet they're breaking my dishes!" said Toad.

31
00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.946
"Come on," said Badger.

32
00:01:58.947 --> 00:02:03.336
And they hurried along.

